          "next": [
            202160004
          ]
        },
        "202160004": {
          "id": 202160004,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "Every time I look at the stars, I imagine what I could do in the cosmos",
          "next": [
            202160005
          ]
        },
        "202160005": {
          "id": 202160005,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "Hehe, Cyrene, the Knight of Beauty. Sounds pretty great, don't you think?",
          "next": [
            202160006
          ]
        },
        "202160006": {
          "id": 202160006,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "If I open my mind a little, wouldn't I make a good \"Stella Hunter\"? Or maybe... a Nameless?",
          "next": [
            202160007
          ]
        },
        "202160007": {
          "id": 202160007,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "But those wishes are far too extravagant",
          "next": [
            202160008
          ]
        },
        "202160008": {
          "id": 202160008,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "I already have a star that no one else has ever had, right♪",
          "next": [
            202160009
          ]
        },
        "202160009": {
          "id": 202160009,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "As long as I gaze at it longingly, light will fall into my eyes",
          "next": [
            202160010
          ]
        },
        "202160010": {
          "id": 202160010,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "Maybe this is my greatest wish...",
          "next": [
            202160011
          ]
        },
        "202160011": {
          "id": 202160011,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "{NICKNAME}, on the long road ahead, you must keep on shining, alright?",
          "next": [
            202160012
          ]
        },
        "202160012": {
          "id": 202160012,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "Oh, did I make the atmosphere too sad...?",
          "next": [
            202160013
          ]
        },
        "202160013": {
          "id": 202160013,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "Then just look up at the sky and smile!",
          "next": [
            202160014
          ]
        },
        "202160014": {
          "id": 202160014,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "Wherever you go, the stars of Amphoreus will forever twinkle for you, just like I am winking at you~",
          "next": [
            202160015
          ]
        },
        "202160015": {
          "id": 202160015,
          "type": "Text",
          "sender": "NPC",
          "senderContactId": 1415,
          "text": "And then, we will surely, surely meet again beneath the starlight ♪",
          "next": [
            202160016
          ]
        },
        "202160016": {
          "id": 202160016,
          "type": "Sticker",
